# Registry routing only — NEVER commit a credential here.
#
# @mnmal-ai/* resolves from GitHub Packages, matching every other package in
# this org. This package publishes there too (see `publishConfig` in
# package.json); the mapping below also covers any @mnmal-ai/* dependency it
# picks up later.
#
# The auth token deliberately does NOT live here. pnpm >=11 ignores registry
# credentials that come from a project .npmrc — even `${VAR}` refs — because
# the file is committed and could otherwise leak the secret to an attacker-
# controlled registry. The registry mapping is still honoured; only credential
# lines are dropped.
#
# Supply the token from a source pnpm trusts:
#   local — pnpm config set "//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken" <token>
#   CI    — an "Authenticate to GitHub Packages" step writing ~/.npmrc
@mnmal-ai:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
